Use symmetry to find the left-hand area at the negative boundary.
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}P(-0.73<Z<1.46)\\&=P(Z<1.46)-P(Z<-0.73)\\&=P(Z<1.46)-[1-P(Z<0.73)]\\&=0.9279-(1-0.7673)\\&=0.9279-0.2327\\&=0.6952\end{aligned}$
