Standardise each boundary using $z=\dfrac{x-\mu}{\sigma}$.
$\begin{aligned}z_{\text{lower}}&=\dfrac{242-250}{10}\\&=-0.8\end{aligned}$
$\begin{aligned}z_{\text{upper}}&=\dfrac{263-250}{10}\\&=1.3\end{aligned}$
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}P(242<X<263)\\&=P(-0.8<Z<1.3)\\&=P(Z<1.3)-[1-P(Z<0.8)]\\&=0.9032-(1-0.7881)\\&=0.6913\end{aligned}$
The expected frequency is $f=np$.
$\begin{aligned}f&=1200\times0.6913\\&=829.56\\&\approx830\end{aligned}$
Expect approximately $830$ packets.
