\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The top $15\%$ leaves an area of $0.85$ below the boundary. The closest table value is $0.8508$, giving $z=1.04$.
$\begin{aligned}x&=\mu+z\sigma\\&=55+1.04\times12\\&=67.48\\&\approx67.5\end{aligned}$
The approximate boundary is $67.5$ marks.
