The fastest $25\%$ lies below a negative boundary. By symmetry, its positive counterpart has an area of $0.75$ to the left. The closest table value is $0.7486$, so the required score is $z=-0.67$.
$\begin{aligned}x&=\mu+z\sigma\\&=80+(-0.67)\times15\\&=69.95\\&\approx70.0\end{aligned}$
The approximate boundary is $70.0$ seconds.
